WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
This owned .fig is open as native, editable layers.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Select CTA Button in the layer list.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Change its fill in the native inspector.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The new color appears on the canvas.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Undo the color change.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
The original orange returns.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Redo brings the new color back.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Save the project.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The saved project reopens with the edit intact.
File navigation omitted.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Later: inspect the actual PNG exported from this saved design.

